        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our Factory operations, we manufacture prototype and low volume production parts for companies worldwide, who are under increasing pressure to bring their finished products to market faster than their competition.",
