        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We accomplish this by offering a variety of manufacturing capabilities fulfilled through a combination of owned manufacturing factories (\"Factory\") and a worldwide network of premium manufacturing partners (\"Network\").",
